<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-S&amp;P rates Australia's SPAR paper A-1.</title>
<headline>RTRS-S&amp;P rates Australia's SPAR paper A-1.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ratings agency Standard &amp; Poors Corp (S&amp;P) said on Monday it had assigned its A-1 rating to Structured Prime Asset Receivables No. 1 Ltd's (SPAR) A$500 million commercial paper programme.  </p>
<p>&quot;The A-1 rating reflects foreign exchange and collateral swap contracts with appropriately rated counterparties and the sound legal structure of the transaction,&quot; S&amp;P said.</p>
<p>SPAR is a special purpose company incorporated in New South Wales and the proceeds of the paper issue are used to purchase a portfolo of equity securities and the swap contracts, S&amp;P said.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
